fficial","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Room 907 is bookable. Confirm current Caltech Hall entry rules, ninth-floor availability, and reservation procedures with the Library.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"caltech-ccid-lounge","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"CCID Lounge","title":"Gather Around Community Programming","subtitle":"Center for Inclusion and Diversity lounge","notes":"Use the lounge for an eligible community gathering or program, and follow CCID’s booking process before planning exclusive group use.","short_summary":"A reservable gathering space connected to Caltech’s inclusion and cultural-exchange programs.","evidence_claim":"The Caltech Center for Inclusion and Diversity directly provides a booking pathway for the CCID Lounge and CSS Common Area.","source_url":"https://ccid.caltech.edu/resources/ccid-services","source_title":"CCID Services","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Booking is handled through CCID. Programs and support structures are available to the campus community, but room use remains subject to approval.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"caltech-music-house","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Music House","title":"Practice Without Taking Over a Lounge","subtitle":"Card-access rehearsal rooms at 305 South Hill Avenue","notes":"Request card access before your first visit, then use a practice room for solo or chamber work without displacing a scheduled coaching.","short_summary":"A dedicated music facility with ensemble rooms, pianos, and smaller practice rooms.","evidence_claim":"Caltech documents a large rehearsal room with two grand pianos, two chamber rooms, and five practice rooms at Music House; its chamber-music page explains student card a